SOLUTION:
This challenge involves image dithering techniques to reveal hidden flags.
Use the provided ctf_dither_solver.py script to solve:

python3 ctf_dither_solver.py https://cybersecure-x-dit.chals.io/

The script will download the image and apply various dithering techniques:
- Threshold dithering (multiple threshold values)
- Floyd-Steinberg error diffusion dithering  
- Bit plane extraction (0-7)
- Color quantization (for RGB images)

Look for flag patterns in the generated images in the results/ folder.
The hint "Sometimes less is more" refers to reducing color depth/information.
